  "notes": "Compound of {再|さい} (again) + {建|けん} (to build). Covers both physical rebuilding and figurative restructuring.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {再建|さいけん}する (to rebuild, to restructure)\n- {経営|けいえい}{再建|さいけん} (business restructuring)\n- {財政|ざいせい}{再建|さいけん} (fiscal restructuring)\n- {生活|せいかつ}の{再建|さいけん} (rebuilding one's life)\n- {再建|さいけん}{計画|けいかく} (reconstruction plan)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {再建|さいけん}: rebuilding something that was lost or destroyed; implies restoring to a former state\n- {建|た}て{替|か}え: rebuilding by demolishing the old and constructing anew (not after destruction)\n- {復興|ふっこう}: recovery and revitalization on a larger scale (of a region or nation)",
